 "differences": [
  "The deposit holds 29 runs and 150,813 logged key presses; 148,774 of them are among the paper's 32 characters, 35 more than Table I (148,739): the paper kept only its 32 characters (letters a-z, space, period, comma, enter, backspace, apostrophe) and dropped blocks with other keys; all logged keys are kept here, including 2,039 presses of capital letters, digits and rare symbols.",
